      <data key="d5">"education, scholarly influence"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0086</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;GABRIEL DÉPÉRET&quot;" target="&quot;LEGACY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Gabriel Dépéret's contributions to the field of medicine have had a lasting impact on the organization, suggesting a strong association with the organization's mission and achievements."</data>
      <data key="d5">"contributor, impact"</data>
